# FestWiz mode switch — see HALLOWEEN-PLAN.md
#
# Rules are tried in order, first match wins. The two passthroughs come
# first so each app is always reachable at its own path; the single wildcard
# after them decides what "/" serves, and that is the whole mode switch.

# Identity passthroughs. Both apps stay reachable at their own paths in
# either mode; only the LAST rule decides what "/" serves. Without a
# passthrough an app's own path is swallowed by the wildcard below it.
/southbysouthwest/*  /southbysouthwest/:splat  200
/halloween/*         /halloween/:splat         200

# ── FESTIVAL MODE (active) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
/*                   /southbysouthwest/:splat  200

# ── HALLOWEEN MODE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Comment out the one rule above, uncomment this one. The passthroughs stay.
# /*                   /halloween/:splat         200
